<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Welcome to Terminal — The Crawl Price Index</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,6..72,300;0,6..72,400;0,6..72,500;1,6..72,300&family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  body{margin:0;background:var(--ink);color:var(--fg);font-family:"Newsreader",Georgia,serif;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
  p{color:var(--fg);font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;max-width:44ch;margin:0 auto 14px}
  .card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:4px;padding:20px;margin:24px 0;text-align:left}
  .card a{color:var(--signal);text-decoration:none;font-family:"Spline Sans Mono",monospace;font-size:15px;word-break:break-all}
</style>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/theme.css">
</head>
<body class="prose">
<div class="masthead"><div class="wrap">
  <a class="mark" href="/">The Crawl Price Index<b>.</b></a>
  <nav class="navmid">
    <a class="lnk" href="/why">Why it matters</a>
    <a class="lnk" href="/check">Check a domain</a>
    <a class="lnk" href="/explore">Explore data</a>
    <a class="lnk" href="/methodology">Method</a>
  </nav>
  <div class="navend">
    <a class="lnk signin" href="https://app.crawlpriceindex.com">Sign in</a>
    <a class="btn" href="https://app.crawlpriceindex.com/dashboard.html#account">Full dataset &mdash; &euro;49/mo</a>
  </div>
</div></div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="mark">Terminal · access confirmed</div>
    <h1>You're in.</h1>
    <p>Thank you for subscribing. Your Terminal access to the full Crawl Price Index — per-domain history, the publisher panel, per-country editions, and the machine-readable feed — is now active.</p>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="mono">Your API key is on its way</div>
      <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--dim);margin:10px 0 0">Check your email — we've just sent your personal API key to the address on your subscription. Use it to pull the full dataset (with trends &amp; weekly history) from <a href="/">crawlpriceindex.com</a>'s API.</p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin:12px 0 0 0" class="mono">GET api.crawlpriceindex.com/v1/dataset?key=YOUR_KEY</p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--dim);margin:12px 0 0">Didn't get it? <a href="/recover.html">Recover your key</a> or write to hello@crawlpriceindex.com. Terms: <a href="/terms.html">single-subscriber licence</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href="/">← Back to the index</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
